<title>USA: Enteractive Inc Q3 Feb 28 net loss narrows.</title>
<headline>Enteractive Inc Q3 Feb 28 net loss narrows.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>For the Three Months Ended  For the Nine Months Ended</p>
<p>		   2/28/97     2/29/96	2/28/97	2/29/96</p>
<p>Total revenues</p>
<p>		   267,800	153,300    1,449,900	685,800</p>
<p>Acquired in-process</p>
<p>research and</p>
<p>  development	 --    1,915,100	     --    1,915,100</p>
<p>Net loss  (1,986,700)  (3,638,900)  (5,490,100)  (6,378,800) Loss per common</p>
<p>and common</p>
<p>equivalent share</p>
<p>		    (0.26)	 (0.76)	 (0.71)	 (1.34)</p>
<p>Weighted average shares</p>
<p>of common stock and</p>
<p>common stock</p>
<p>equivalents</p>
<p>		 7,679,441    4,775,489    7,679,295    4,775,489</p>
<p>NOTE: Net income for the third quarter of 1997 include $225,800 of non-cash charges related to amortization of capitalized software and consulting expenses paid through the issuance of stock options.</p>
<p>Net income for the first nine months of 1997 include $677,500 of non-cash charges related to amortization of capitalized software and consulting expenses paid through the issuance of stock options. $1,915,100 related to the write off of acquired in-process research and development incurred in connection with Lyriq International Corp.</p>
